Package: core
Version: @VERSION@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Maintainer: core contributors <techbasegit@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/@REPO@
Description: Device tree overlays for the carrier-board peripherals
 Installs the overlays for the peripherals of the CM3, CM4, CM4S and CM5
 carrier boards (ADC, CAN, TPM, RTC, LEDs, I/O expanders, the SC16IS740
 serial port) and the boot-related fixes for CM3 and CM5 into
 /boot/firmware/overlays.
 .
 It does not enable any of them. Which overlays a board loads is decided by
 config.txt, and this package leaves config.txt alone.
